  <p>Warp pad room. After accepting a quest at the guild counter, the player walks here to teleport to the field.</p>

  <h2>Interactions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Warp Pad</strong> — teleports to the quest's field area. Only active when a quest is accepted.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Exits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Back → <a href="/journey/city/counter">Guild Counter</a></li>
  </ul>
</Definition>
